# Example: mount dsh-ui-background into a deepseek-harness web profile.
#
# This is a *source-only* plugin. Before this patch applies, the package must
# be present under `packages/client/ui-background/` (see readme Installation)
# and the `chat-background` namespace must be added to WEB_SETTINGS_NAMESPACES
# in `packages/host/apiproxy/src/api-proxy.ts`, or the browser cannot read the
# persisted section.
#
# Merge the row below into `packages/bundle/web-app/cordis.patch.yml` under
# the `- insert:` roster (near the other `id: ui-*` client rows), then add
# `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-background` to the bundle's `package.json`
# dependencies and rebuild the client shell.

- insert:
    - id: ui-background
      name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-background'
